{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The application fails to comply with the terms of Article 3, Schedule 2, Part 3, Class MA of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) for the following reasons: \r\nThe applicant has failed to submit adequate information regarding transport, and the proposal would result in a harmful living environment for future tenants with limited natural light. The proposal is therefore contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1, CC2, CC4, SC7, EC2 and Part 3, Class MA, Paragraph MA.2 (2)(a) and (f) of the Town and County Planning (General Permitted Development)(England) Order (2015)(as amended).\r\n"
